WEBVTT

00:06:29.279 --> 00:06:34.306
Thank you, and peace and blessings.

00:06:34.312 --> 00:06:39.944
(Applause)

00:06:39.944 --> 00:06:42.715
Thank you. (Applause)

00:06:42.715 --> 00:06:46.015
Pat Mitchell: So, you heard Maya talk about

00:06:46.015 --> 00:06:48.838
the amazing parents who are behind

00:06:48.838 --> 00:06:51.055
this incredible woman. Where are they?

00:06:51.055 --> 00:06:54.053
Please, Mr. and Mrs. Penn. Would you just -- Ah!

00:06:54.053 --> 00:06:57.807
(Applause)